  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& { }^n C_1+{ }^n C_2=36 \\Rightarrow n=8 \\\\\n& T_3=7 \\mathrm{~T}_2 \\Rightarrow\\left(2^{\\mathrm{x}}\\right)^3=1 / 2 \\\\\n& 3 \\mathrm{x}=-1 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{x}=-\\frac{1}{3}\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
